{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896","id":1982445289,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f852Kbbp","number":101896,"title":"Misleading error message for search shard unavailablity in stateless","user":{"login":"jakelandis","id":976291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NjI5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis","html_url":"https://github.com/jakelandis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":836504707,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MzY1MDQ3MDc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Distributed/Distributed","name":":Distributed/Distributed","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"A catch all label for anything in the Distributed Area. Please avoid if you can."},{"id":1967496670,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2Njcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Distributed","name":"Team:Distributed","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for distributed team."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2023-11-07T23:50:26Z","updated_at":"2023-11-30T16:38:58Z","closed_at":"2023-11-30T16:38:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The following error message emitted from org.elasticsearch.action.support.replication.ReplicationOperation is misleading:\r\n\r\n```\r\nNot enough active copies to meet shard count of [1] (have 1, needed 1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nfull context:\r\n```\r\norg.elasticsearch.transport.RemoteTransportException: [es-es-index-58f985f8f-pgls6][10.2.12.197:9300][indices:data/write/bulk[s][p]]\r\nCaused by: org.elasticsearch.action.UnavailableShardsException: [.security-7][0] Not enough active copies to meet shard count of [1] (have 1, needed 1). Timeout: [1m], request: [BulkShardRequest [[.security-7][0]] containing [index {[.security][myrole], source[{\"enabled\":true,\"roles\":[\"myrole\"],\"rules\":{\"all\":[{\"field\":{\"realm.name\":\"myrealm\"}},{\"field\":{\"username\":\"me\"}}]},\"metadata\":{},\"doc_type\":\"role-mapping\"}]}] and a refresh]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe message appears to be due to the calculation for wait_for_active_shards only counts search shards, but the message is constructed by counting all shards. In stateless this message can mean that the search shard is not available. \r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kingherc","id":5519665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTk2NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5519665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc","html_url":"https://github.com/kingherc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingherc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/101896/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}